      "lineNbr": 96,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-07-18T20:47:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Temporarily is how \u0027wp disable\u0027 works now.  It overrides until the next non-hibernate boot.\n\nAt boot is what RMA needs.  WP disable needs to persist until explicitly re-enabled.\n\nThat\u0027s all implemented in the next patch (coming today).",
